Comlist   mpechoat $n You decide to commit suicide by pushing the button.
mpechoaround $n $n begins to push the button.
mpechoaround $n You decide that leaving would be a good idea.
pull button
mptransfer $n 32295
open w
mpforce all wake
mpforce all stand
mpforce all w
close w
mpgoto 32295
mptransfer $n 32296
mpgoto 32296
mpechoat $n The air pressure drops quickly.
if race($n) == Vordan
mpechoat $n Thank god you're a Vordan.
else
mpechoat $n Moments later you are dead.
mpslay $n
endif
~
#ENDPROG

#ENDOBJECT

