street is suspended high above the ground as is dwarfed on all sides by
massive skyscrapers. Looking over the high railing at the edge of the road
you can see other similar streets many stories bellow and several more up
above. All around the city is bustling with activity.

Terran Union transit signs share the streetscape with old European stonework and newer composite towers.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    320
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    306
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction west~
ToRoom    308
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 303 50 307
  Reset E 1 308 1 7
  Reset E 1 307 1 5
Reset M 0 312 100 307
  Reset E 1 331 1 12
#ENDROOM

