#ROOM
Vnum     400
Name     A Turbolift~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob indoors~
Desc     This is one of many turbolifts found throughout Directorate City (or
The Hague Government Quarter) on Earth. It runs up and down connecting several
levels of streets. Most people travel only on the upper levels of the city
and on most of these lifts the bottom levels have been disabled
completely.

Terran Union transit signs share the streetscape with old European stonework and newer composite towers.
~
