#ROOM
Vnum     420
Name     Hotel Cafeteria~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob indoors safe~
Desc     The hotel cafeteria isn't very fancy or even that clean, but the aroma of
food coming from the kitchen smalls delicious. There are several tables
scattered about the room. A few plants hang from the ceiling and some
pretty tastless pictures line the walls.

The streets belong to a future The Hague: dense, international, heavily connected and unmistakably Earth-born.
~
