#ROOM
Vnum     427
Name     Inside a Directorate City Turbolift~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob indoors~
Desc     A clean composite-metal elevator car hums softly around you. A luminous control panel is set beside the doors, while a narrow indicator above it shows the current street level. The car is designed to move vertically through Directorate City's stacked transport levels.
~
