#ROOM
Vnum     431
Name     Skydome Transit Station~
Sector   city~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     This Transit station is one of many interconnected maglev car stations
running through The Hague Government Quarter. Its probably the easiest fasted and
cheapest way to get around the enormous city and thus is a favoured means 
of transportation.

Pedestrians move between diplomatic offices, markets, housing and interstellar transport links.
~
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    351
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction west~
ToRoom    432
#ENDEXIT

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     432
Name     Ticket booth~
Sector   city~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     For one small fee you can ride the maglev car transit system to almost
anywhere throught Directorate City. The turnstile allows one person through
at a time as they pay the robot on duty. The cost is 5 credits.

The streets belong to a future The Hague: dense, international, heavily connected and unmistakably Earth-born.
~
#EXIT
