#ROOM
Vnum     449
Name     Government Road~
Sector   city~
Desc     You stand on government road which is located at the heart of Directorate City
(or The Hague Government Quarter) on Earth. The To the north of you looms the
enormous Directorate palace, which is now the governing seat of the New
Union. To your west lies the Assembly Hall where all the leaders of the
galaxy come together monthly and discuss issues of galactic importance.
There is a ring of voting booths in the Assembly Hall in which citizens may
come and post their opinions to the governing bodies.

Pedestrians move between diplomatic offices, markets, housing and interstellar transport links.
~
