#ROOM
Vnum     462
Name     A Bedroom~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob indoors~
Desc     This bedroom is plain and small. It is completely unfirnished except for a
large bed that semms to be the focus of the room. The carpet is covered in
stains as are the sheets. The wallpaper is peeling off in spots as well...
but at this point, who cares.

The streets belong to a future The Hague: dense, international, heavily connected and unmistakably Earth-born.
~
