#ROOM
Vnum     465
Name     An Office~
Sector   city~
Desc     The smells and sounds of the brothel fill this office, but it all seems
more pleasant here in this nicely furnished office. A large wooden desk is
the focus of the room. It is around the walls of the room are a few
bookshelves and several filing cabinets. The chair to the desk is very
large. The room is decorated with an intersting assortment of unusual
sexual aids. Some of which you can't even begin to imagine what they could
possibly be used for.

The streets belong to a future The Hague: dense, international, heavily connected and unmistakably Earth-born.
~
